TYPE tau_I
TYPE tau_A
TYPE tau_V

ENTITY I0
QUALIFY I0 type tau_I
ENTITY I1
QUALIFY I1 type tau_I
ENTITY I2
QUALIFY I2 type tau_I
POSITION_NEXT I0 I1
POSITION_NEXT I1 I2

ENTITY A6
QUALIFY A6 type tau_A
ENTITY A2
QUALIFY A2 type tau_A
ENTITY A7
QUALIFY A7 type tau_A
ENTITY V1
QUALIFY V1 type tau_V
ENTITY V2
QUALIFY V2 type tau_V
ENTITY V7
QUALIFY V7 type tau_V

PAIR A6V1 A6 V1
QUALIFY A6V1 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
PAIR A2V2 A2 V2
QUALIFY A2V2 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
PAIR A7V7 A7 V7
QUALIFY A7V7 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
PAIR A6V2 A6 V2
QUALIFY A6V2 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

ENTITY CXE2T3
QUALIFY CXE2T3 kind context
QUALIFY CXE2T3 type tau_CX
QUALIFY CXE2T3 base_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CXE2T3 distinguishes_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CXE2T3 member A6V1
QUALIFY CXE2T3 member A2V2
QUALIFY CXE2T3 member A7V7
QUALIFY CXE2T3 member A6V2

ENTITY U1
QUALIFY U1 kind stream
QUALIFY U1 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U1 I0 A6V1
AT U1 I1 A2V2
AT U1 I2 A7V7

ENTITY U2
QUALIFY U2 kind stream
QUALIFY U2 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U2 I0 A2V2
AT U2 I1 A7V7
AT U2 I2 A6V2

ENTITY U3
QUALIFY U3 kind stream
QUALIFY U3 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U3 I0 A7V7
AT U3 I1 A6V1

ENTITY E2T3
QUALIFY E2T3 kind task
QUALIFY E2T3 context CXE2T3
QUALIFY E2T3 input U1
QUALIFY E2T3 input U2
QUALIFY E2T3 input U3
UNKNOWN_AT E2T3 XE2T3 U3 I2 Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
